#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:2
msgid "Traffic analytics"
msgstr "流量分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:4
msgid ""
"Read the Docs aggregates statistics about visits to your documentation. This"
" is mainly information about how often pages are viewed, and which return a "
"`404 Not Found` error code."
msgstr "Read the Docs 汇总关于文档访问的统计数据。主要是页面被查看的频率，以及哪些页面返回 `404 Not Found` 错误码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:8
msgid ""
"Traffic analytics let you see *which* documents your users are reading. This"
" allows you to understand how your documentation is being used, so you can "
"focus on expanding and updating parts people are reading most."
msgstr "流量分析让你看清用户正在阅读*哪些* 文档。这能帮你了解文档的使用方式，从而专注于扩展和更新用户阅读最多的部分。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:12
msgid ""
"To see a list of the top pages from the last month, go to your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Traffic analytics`."
msgstr "要查看过去一个月访问最多的页面列表，前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Traffic analytics` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:15
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:20
msgid "Traffic analytics demo"
msgstr "流量分析演示"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:23
msgid "Enabling traffic analytics"
msgstr "启用流量分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:25
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Analytics`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Analytics` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:26
msgid "Check :guilabel:`Analytics enabled`."
msgstr "勾选 :guilabel:`Analytics enabled` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:29
msgid "Data storage"
msgstr "数据存储"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:31
msgid "The duration of analytics data stored depends on which site you're using:"
msgstr "分析数据的存储时长取决于你使用的站点："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:33
msgid "On |org_brand|, the last 90 days are stored."
msgstr "|org_brand| 存储最近 90 天。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:34
msgid ""
"On |com_brand|, storage duration starts at 30 days and increases with plan "
"level."
msgstr "|com_brand| 存储时长从 30 天起，随套餐等级提升。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:38
msgid "`Our plan pricing <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`_"
msgstr "`Our plan pricing <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/>`_"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:39
msgid "Compare our plan pricing and analytics storage duration."
msgstr "比较我们的套餐定价与分析数据存储时长。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:41
msgid ":doc:`/search-analytics`"
msgstr ":doc:`/search-analytics`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/traffic-analytics.rst:42
